      "shouldTranslate": true
    },
    "El asistente consulta el Bastion y te propone el modo adecuado. Puedes cambiarlo en **Ajustes ⚙️**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant checks the bastion and suggests the right mode. You can change it in **Settings ⚙️**."
